OL,3,GNEWSAPolitician 'will not be deterred'
OL,4,Aafter Dublin assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Irish politician who was assaulted
OL,7,Fafter his car was stopped in traffic in
OL,8,Fcentral Dublin has said he "will not be
OL,9,Fdeterred" from continuing his work.
OL,11,FIndependent TD Michael Healy-Rae was
OL,12,Fattacked by a man after 16:00 local
OL,13,Ftime on Wednesday.
OL,15,FHealy-Rae was stopped at traffic lights
OL,16,Fon Cork Street when a passer-by walked
OL,17,Fover to the open car window and punched
OL,18,Fhim in the face.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
