OL,3,GNEWSAPolitician 'will not be deterred'
OL,4,Aafter Dublin assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement on social media, he
OL,7,Fsaid: "We do need to have a serious
OL,8,Fconversation about the growing toxicity
OL,9,Fdirected towards politicians and public
OL,10,Frepresentatives."
